sequenceDiagram
  participant C as OCC / Compute
  participant S as Source control
  participant E as Egress driver
  participant B as Sandbox
  participant L as Refresh owner
  participant I as Issuer
  Note over C,I: Proposed contracts, not separate daemons, calls/returns do not imply implementation
  Note over C,S: Trusted Backend factory binds immutable identities and versioned provider schemas
  Note over C,S: New static sources default live, existing sources keep approved version / snapshot<br/>Exact source-update authority required for live opt-in
  Note over C,S: Validate selected store, scope and exact version<br/>Failed opt-in preserves approved admission, known revocation denies
  C->>S: applySource(Source, Command)
  S-->>C: Change of SourceStatus
  Note over C,S: Applied configuration is not material readiness
  opt Dynamic source
    C->>L: configureRefresh(LifecycleConfig, Command)
    L-->>C: Accepted configuration
    Note over L,I: One fenced owner per family, warm while Agents are idle
    L->>L: Persist exact attempt and uncertainty marker
    Note over L,I: SecretDriver.readCredentialInput for authorized roots only<br/>Canonical rotated input supersedes bootstrap seed
    L->>I: issue(IssuerAttempt, Bounds)
    I->>I: Owner-authorized provider exchange<br/>Provider definition validates actual grant / expiry
    I-->>L: Candidate, known refusal or uncertain attempt
    L->>L: Commit replacement input and candidate before readiness
    C->>L: refreshStatus(WarmKey, Bounds)
    L-->>C: Readiness and activity reported separately
    Note over C,L: Valid old material stays ready during routine renewal, cold required grants have a bounded wait
  end
  C->>E: configureRevision(Plan, Command)
  E-->>C: Change of exact Attachment
  C->>B: installEgress(Attachment, Command)
  B-->>C: Change of InstallReceipt
  C->>E: attachmentStatus joins Sandbox egressStatus
  E-->>C: Exact generation and binding set
  Note over C,I: Known partial failure: failed plus cleanup obligations, unknown effects: inspect / reconcile, no blind replay
  Note over C,B: Static usability is checked during resolve, authenticated Harness serving is a separate gate
